'''Kyubey Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be obtaineed when beating any stage in [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event#Be A Magical Girl II|Be a Magical Girl II]] during the [[Puella Magi Madoka Magica Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 301
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Kyubey Cat
|name2 = Tank Kyubey Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Tank Kyubey Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
==='''Normal Form'''===
Very similar to [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cat]] in terms of usage. Cheap and expendable, it can be summoned en masse to take hits in place of other, more important units. This meatshield role is quite valuable, if not for the wide selection of cats able to perform this role without relevant differences in quality. Kyubey Cat, however, is unique in that it can sometimes survive a lethal strike for a negligible extra cost of 15¢, plus it can be used in {{4c}} stages, where there is considerably less competition.

==='''Evolved Form'''===
Kyubey Tank gains extra stats but less speed; however, this does not make it worth the cost increase, as its health still remains very low and even irrelevant during [[Uncanny Legends]] and other late parts of the game. Because of this, the Normal Form should always be used over the Evolved Form.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

